      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. Membership. The Community Relations\nStrategic Planning Group will be chaired by the director of\nthe Mayor's Community Assistance Unit. The Deputy\nCommissioner for Community Relations of the New York City\nCommission on Human Rights and the Deputy Commissioner of\nthe Community Affairs Division of the New York City Police\nDepartment will serve as vice-chairs. The Commissioner of\nthe Department of Parks & Recreation and the Directors of\nthe Community Development Agency, the Mayor's Office of\nYouth Services, and the Youth Bureau will designate\nrepresentatives from their agencies to serve as members\nuntil replaced by designated alternates.",
